[1.7211066000000002,"o","A > Save the twelve-conversation seed corpus\r\n"]
[1.9135266999999998,"o","Saved: Choosing the demand forecast model (chatgpt)\r\n"]
[1.9520130999999998,"o","A > What did we decide about the forecast model?\r\n"]
[1.9520543,"o","  We decided to use a seasonal ARIMA baseline for all stations in the pilot, and to drop gradient boosting until there is enough per-station data to support it.\r\n"]
[1.952068,"o","  We decided to use gradient boosting on lag and weather features for station-level hourly demand.\r\n"]
[1.9520781,"o","  The plan is to size for the ARIMA pilot now and revisit only if the model changes.\r\n"]
[1.9520891,"o","  We decided to ship three read endpoints for the pilot and no write path: station status, six hour forecast per station, and the current van route.\r\n"]
[1.9520987,"o","  We decided to model it as a capacitated VRP with time windows rather than a greedy nearest-deficit heuristic, because the greedy version strands the van at the edge of the network late in the shift.\r\n"]
[1.952194,"o","A > Create an expiring, one-use handoff (bearer link kept private)\r\n"]
